# Optional. Copy to web/.env to override; never commit .env.
#
# Where the browser sends GraphQL requests. Baked into the build (Vite reads
# VITE_* variables at build time). The default, /graphql, is same-origin:
#   - development: Vite proxies /graphql to the API on localhost:4000
#   - production: Caddy serves the app and proxies /graphql to the API
# VITE_API_URL=/graphql
